{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":43.130001068115234,"text":"A palace with no harbor makes no sense. Knossos is five kilometers from the sea, and its harbor was here, at Omnissos. Today, you see low ruins beside the shore, among them a building called the House of the Lilies, because lilies in pots were painted on its walls. Homer names Omnissos in the Odyssey, when Odysseus tells a lie and claims he put in there. It is one of the rare times a poem and an excavation point at the same spot. The most serious find, though, is the pumice. Pumice from the eruption of the Thera volcano was found in the ruins, carried this far across the sea. A stone that floats brought news of a disaster a hundred kilometers away, and left it here for us to read.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.4399999976158142},{"word":"palace","start":0.4399999976158142,"end":0.6399999856948853},{"word":"with","start":0.6399999856948853,"end":0.9399999976158142},{"word":"no","start":0.9399999976158142,"end":1.340000033378601},{"word":"harbor","start":1.340000033378601,"end":1.5},{"word":"makes","start":1.5,"end":1.9800000190734863},{"word":"no","start":1.9800000190734863,"end":2.299999952316284},{"word":"sense","start":2.299999952316284,"end":2.5799999237060547},{"word":"Knossos","start":3.4600000381469727,"end":3.5},{"word":"is","start":3.5,"end":3.880000114440918},{"word":"five","start":3.880000114440918,"end":4.260000228881836},{"word":"kilometers","start":4.260000228881836,"end":4.739999771118164},{"word":"from","start":4.739999771118164,"end":5},{"word":"the","start":5,"end":5.380000114440918},{"word":"sea","start":5.380000114440918,"end":5.400000095367432},{"word":"and","start":5.519999980926514,"end":6.019999980926514},{"word":"its","start":6.019999980926514,"end":6.199999809265137},{"word":"harbor","start":6.199999809265137,"end":6.380000114440918},{"word":"was","start":6.380000114440918,"end":6.679999828338623},{"word":"here","start":6.679999828338623,"end":6.98000001